+	 * guest receive offload is negotiated, which this driver never
+	 * requests; otherwise a buffer need only hold the MTU, a VLAN Ethernet
+	 * header and the virtio header.  Oversized buffers span many cookies,
+	 * and each cookie costs a ring descriptor when indirect descriptors are
+	 * unavailable.
